                "text": "Friendly reminder: A bipartisan majority voted to establish these nutrition waivers because no child should go hungry. As\u00a0supply chain and labor disruptions continue to challenge our food systems, allowing our safety nets to expire\u00a0will fail our children.\n\nhttps://t.co/gOWi8E8C1C",
