                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In a world full of uncertainties for kids, food security should not be one of them. \n\nI teamed up with @RepSpanberger to send a letter to House Leadership calling for a path forward to extend @USDA\u2019s school nutrition program flexibilities through the 2022-2023 school year. https://t.co/YiuCVH4ROd",
