                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Given the ongoing supply chain disruptions and labor shortages plaguing our school nutrition systems, lifting this lifeline prematurely would be a huge mistake - one that will leave millions of children unsure of where their next meal is coming from.\n\nhttps://t.co/DZUA8ZNWzj",
