                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If the universal school meals put in place during the pandemic expire, schools will see a 40% reduction in funding for food, leaving kids hungry and nutrition departments grappling with high prices. That's why I'm taking the lead on this issue in the House with @RepSpanberger. https://t.co/8hQlLeDQHR",
