                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve been sounding the alarm on the expiring universal school meal issue since March and am relieved by our solution: the Keep Kids Fed Act, which extends flexibilities provided by Families First to ensure schools can continue to provide students with the nutrition they deserve.",
