                "text": "House Democrats are fighting for the next generation\u2019s mental and physical wellness. Together, we\u2019ve passed:\n\u00a0\n\ud83e\udde1 The Bipartisan Safer Communities Act\n\ud83e\udde1 The Protecting Our Kids Act\u00a0\n\ud83e\udde1 The Mental Health Matters Act\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s how @HouseDemocrats put #PeopleOverPolitics.",
