                "text": "Agriculture and nutrition policy goes hand-in-hand. We can't discuss fighting hunger in America without supporting our farmers and ranchers. \n\nThat's why I'll vote for a farm bill that supports everyone: farm families and the families they feed. #NationalAgDay",
